\input docstrip

\keepsilent
\askforoverwritefalse

\declarepreamble\stylepreamble

This is the `ufrj-coppe' unit style of the `ufrj' document class: the data
and texts of the Instituto Alberto Luiz Coimbra de Pos-Graduacao e Pesquisa
de Engenharia (COPPE) of the Federal University of Rio de Janeiro, as the
COPPE norm for theses and dissertations fixes them. It is generated from
ufrj-coppe.dtx by docstrip; edit the .dtx source, not this file.

Copyright (C) 2008-2026 Vicente Helano F. Batista, George O. Ainsworth Jr.,
Geraldo Xexéo and Eduardo Mangeli.

This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
it under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 3 as
published by the Free Software Foundation.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,
but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of
MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the
GNU General Public License version 3 for more details.

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License
version 3 along with this package (see the COPYING.txt file).
If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.

Author(s): Vicente Helano F. Batista
           George O. Ainsworth Jr.
           Geraldo Xexéo
           Eduardo Mangeli

\endpreamble

\declarepreamble\examplepreamble

This is a sample monograph which illustrates the use of the `ufrj' document
class with the `ufrj-coppe' unit style and its biblatex/biber bibliography
style. It is generated from ufrj-coppe.dtx by docstrip.

Copyright (C) 2008-2026 Vicente Helano F. Batista, George O. Ainsworth Jr.,
Geraldo Xexéo and Eduardo Mangeli. Released under the GNU General Public
License version 3 (see the COPYING.txt file).

\endpreamble

\declarepreamble\demopreamble

This is one of the demonstration documents of the `ufrj' document class with
the `ufrj-coppe' unit style: the five main-language demos and the
side-by-side cover sheet.  It is generated from ufrj-coppe.dtx by docstrip;
edit the .dtx source, not this file.

Copyright (C) 2008-2026 Vicente Helano F. Batista, George O. Ainsworth Jr.,
Geraldo Xexéo and Eduardo Mangeli. Released under the GNU General Public
License version 3 (see the COPYING.txt file).

\endpreamble

\postamble
% end of `ufrj-coppe' customized files
\endpostamble

\usedir{tex/latex/ufrj}
\generate{%
  \usepreamble\stylepreamble
  \file{ufrj-coppe.sty}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{package}}%
% A classe coppe so existe para que um trabalho escrito ate a v4.1 continue
% compilando: carrega a ufrj e o ufrj-coppe, e avisa.
  \file{coppe.cls}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{compat}}%
  \usepreamble\examplepreamble
  \file{max-exemplo.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{maxexemplo}}%
  \file{min-exemplo.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{minexemplo}}%
% Documentos de demonstracao: os cinco idiomas principais e a montagem das
% capas.
  \usepreamble\demopreamble
  \file{example_pt.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{examplept}}%
  \file{example_en.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{exampleen}}%
  \file{example_es.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{examplees}}%
  \file{example_fr.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{examplefr}}%
  \file{example_it.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{exampleit}}%
  \file{covers_5languages.tex}{\from{ufrj-coppe.dtx}{covers}}%
}
\endbatchfile
